        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/{size}/1961_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-23T14:34:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I can imagine great converstions about the good old days, and Setback sitting there, \"But Amanda, we're good guys.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Amanda: \"Sorry Pete, I was happy blowing up another Organization warehouse for our date tonight… you're the one who insisted on dinner.\"</p>\n<p>Ansel: \"Oh, blow up a warehouse, that sounds like fun! Want me to come along? Normally I would charge but these things, but this time I do it for free. &nbsp;It would be like the good old days.\"</p>\n<p>Pete: <em>facepalm</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
